	)
	(text "TPS63802: VSYS 2.9-4.4 V to +3V3, 2 A, 11 uA Iq. EN divider = hardware UVLO: on at 3.25 V, off at 2.96 V (protects the cell even if firmware"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 204.47 165.1 0)
		(effects
			(font (size 1 1))
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "f69577a7-c508-5095-80cf-8fd8edea2bd0")
	)
	(text "fails), 100 nF so load steps cannot trip it. MODE low = PFM. FB 536k/100k = 3.18 V (3.10-3.27 V over the tolerances, 3.32 V with the FB bias"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 204.47 167.64 0)
		(effects
			(font (size 1 1))
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "5dd3c090-6ece-55e1-9f77-53406a7e8add")
	)
	(text "current: at the panel VCI 3.3 V maximum, far under its 4.6 V absolute maximum). L = 0.47 uH only."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 204.47 170.18 0)
		(effects
			(font (size 1 1))
			(justify left bottom)
